  "id": "spiritual-factor",
  "term": "spiritual factor",
  "definition": "In this assessment context, a spiritual factor is a grouped pattern of responses reflecting emotional and spiritual concerns within the electronic Holistic Needs Assessment. It was the strongest factor found in the tool’s item structure and may help guide support when a person reports many problems at once.",
